Package: SwitchClass
Title: Label-Switch Classification for Baseline- and Perturbation-Aligned Features
Version: 0.99.1
Description: Quantifies baseline-aligned and perturbation-aligned molecular
    features across biological perturbations using a label-switch
    classification framework. Provides a unified workflow for identifying
    changes in molecular-feature alignment in longitudinal or comparative
    omics datasets. Includes tools for classification, visualization,
    dimension reduction, and pathway enrichment.
